{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Outline</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;\u2200stround&quot; is a zero-gravity shooting action game characterized by rotational action.</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433170/extras/0ca3e9146547ba7c288c239d9a2bcbb1.poster.avif?t=1767073448\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433170/extras/0ca3e9146547ba7c288c239d9a2bcbb1.webm?t=1767073448\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433170/extras/0ca3e9146547ba7c288c239d9a2bcbb1.mp4?t=1767073448\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Suddenly, the gravity control system stops functioning, leaving the space station in zero gravity. At the same time, unknown creatures captured on the planet being investigated escape.\u00a0Use rotation to survive threats that attack you from above, below, vertically or horizontally, and regain gravity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Rotating action unique to zero gravity</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u3010Rotate, aim and shoot\u3011</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433170/extras/9735499f62bd22abaeb06ebabe33092a.poster.avif?t=1767073448\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433170/extras/9735499f62bd22abaeb06ebabe33092a.webm?t=1767073448\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433170/extras/9735499f62bd22abaeb06ebabe33092a.mp4?t=1767073448\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can only shoot straight ahead.\u00a0Use rotation to target enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u3010Rotate, see through, and get through\u3011</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433170/extras/5a567f3bfeb4e56fd0061dd71dcdd903.poster.avif?t=1767073448\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433170/extras/5a567f3bfeb4e56fd0061dd71dcdd903.webm?t=1767073448\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433170/extras/5a567f3bfeb4e56fd0061dd71dcdd903.mp4?t=1767073448\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can also quickly boost forward.\u00a0Find a direction free of enemies and escape the encirclement.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3433170?t=1767073448","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3433170?t=1767073448","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433170/3612a6168c85d13022dde0992140a1098c461354/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1767073448","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433170/3612a6168c85d13022dde0992140a1098c461354/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1767073448","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3686280,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Outline</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;\u2200stround&quot; is a zero-gravity shooting action game characterized by rotational action.</stro